{{define "subject"}}Your Krabber account has been banned{{end}}

{{define "plainBody"}}
Hi {{.UserName}},

A Krabber moderator banned your account, so you can no longer sign in, and your molts are hidden.

Reason: {{.Reason}}

The rules are in the terms of use: {{.TermsURL}}
{{ with .Contact }}
If you think this was a mistake, write to {{ . }} and tell us why.
{{ end }}
The Krabber team
{{end}}

{{define "htmlBody"}}
<!doctype html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width">
    <meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8">
</head>
<body>
    <p>Hi {{.UserName}},</p>
    <p>A Krabber moderator banned your account, so you can no longer sign in, and your molts are hidden.</p>
    <p><strong>Reason:</strong> {{.Reason}}</p>
    <p>The rules are in the <a href="{{.TermsURL}}">terms of use</a>.</p>
    {{ with .Contact }}<p>If you think this was a mistake, write to <a href="mailto:{{ . }}">{{ . }}</a> and tell us why.</p>{{ end }}
    <p>The Krabber team</p>
</body>
</html>
{{end}}
